[1.1627, "o", "\r\nWorkspace: /tmp/sensai-feature-demo-oekd5vmr\r\nFeature: web\r\nModel: llama3.2:latest\r\nWorking copies: cart-failing/, cart-passing/, cart-working/. Type /exit to finish.\r\nThis is the actual CLI with a preconfigured fictional account; login/keyring are outside this demo.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.167, "o", "\u001b[1mHello Camille! Welcome to Sensai.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.1675, "o", "\u001b[1;2m(\u001b[0m\u001b[2mType \u001b[0m\u001b[2m/\u001b[0m\u001b[2mhelp\u001b[0m\u001b[2m for commands, Press Enter to submit, Alt+Enter for new line, Ctrl+C to exit\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.17, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b[?1l\u001b[?25l\u001b[0m\u001b[?7l\u001b[0m\u001b[J\u001b[0mVous >\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0m \b\u001b[7A\u001b[7C\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.2775, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?7l\u001b[7D\u001b[0mVous > Use web_search to find official pytest documentation for our failing cart assertion. Search for: site:\r\u001b[109Cd\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m       ocs.pytest.org how to assert. Give one documentation title and its URL from the actual results. No JSO\r\u001b[109CN\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m       . Do not fetch yet.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0m \u001b[5A\u001b[25C\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.2858, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?7l\u001b[2A\u001b[26D\u001b[0m\u001b[J\u001b[0mVous > Use web_search to find official pytest documentation for our failing cart assertion. Search for: site:\r\u001b[109Cd\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m       ocs.pytest.org how to assert. Give one documentation title and its URL from the actual results. No JSO\r\u001b[109CN\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m       . Do not fetch yet.\u001b[26D\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2004l"]
